&lt;p&gt;• Offer &amp;amp; Reward Uploads – Manage end-to-end upload of offers, gift cards, and rewards for internal and client requests.&lt;br&gt;• Invoicing Requests – Own the invoicing lifecycle from Proforma Invoice request through to&amp;nbsp;final Tax Invoice and payment tracking.&lt;br&gt;• Reporting incl. Ad Hoc Reports – Support report setup at program launch and fulfil ad hoc&amp;nbsp;client reporting requests.&lt;br&gt;• Offer Testing – Own the ongoing testing cadence for live offers and coordinate merchant&amp;nbsp;outreach for issues found.&lt;br&gt;• Merchant Payouts &amp;amp; Reconciliation – Collect and reconcile merchant MIS/invoices and&amp;nbsp;drive the corresponding client invoicing process.&lt;br&gt;• Inventory Management – Monitor and plan reward code inventory to prevent stock-outs&amp;nbsp;across live programs.&lt;br&gt;• Vendor / Client Onboarding – Collect KYC documentation and coordinate vendor/client&amp;nbsp;onboarding on the Razorpay SAP system.&lt;br&gt;• Cross-functional Coordination – Act as the primary Ops point of contact for Account&amp;nbsp;Managers, Finance, and Partnerships teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mandatory Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• At least 2 years of experience in operations, client operations, or process-heavy coordination roles.&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable managing high-volume, ticket-based workflows across Slack and email with strict&amp;nbsp;TATs.&lt;br&gt;• Proficient in Microsoft Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint) and Google Workspace (Sheets,&amp;nbsp;Docs).&lt;br&gt;• Proficiency with AI tools (e.g., Claude) for automating workflows, report generation, and process documentation is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;• Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with confidence coordinating across internal&amp;nbsp;and external stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;• Strong attention to detail and ability to validate documentation completeness before&amp;nbsp;processing.&lt;br&gt;• Ability to manage multiple concurrent requests and prioritize effectively based on urgency and&amp;nbsp;criticality.&lt;br&gt;• Basic understanding of invoicing/finance workflows (POs, Proforma Invoices, Tax Invoices) is&amp;nbsp;a plus.&lt;br&gt;• Experience with reconciliation or vendor/merchant onboarding processes is a plus.&lt;br&gt;• Highly organized, able to work independently while coordinating across multiple internal&amp;nbsp;teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Bangalore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
