&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and onboard high-potential enterprise channel partners across the country (involves both hunting &amp;amp; farming side).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
