&lt;li&gt;Expertise in maintaining and periodically updating MIS trackers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong legal research and analytical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion to analyse legal aspects of new products related to the fintech space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide timely support as a team member on a wide array of regulatory projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to identify and take up new tasks and be a team player.&lt;/li&gt;
